 "change_scope": [
  "D1 diagnostic: before the existing WNOHANG waitpid reap, a non-reaping waitid(P_PID, WEXITED|WNOHANG|WNOWAIT) check (si_pid zeroed first) detects an exited owned child; on Apple, proc_pidinfo PROC_PIDEXITREASONINFO (24, packed 32-byte struct, payload bounded to 320 bytes) reads the kernel exit reason from the zombie, falling back to PROC_PIDEXITREASONBASICINFO (25) on ENOMEM. Recorded once per attempt in the journal (line kept under 1024 bytes) and the snapshot; never changes wait status, ownership, signals or outcome.",
  "F1 cleanup: poll_desktop_shutdown stays Pending while any owned application is not terminal, so one incomplete application no longer ends the bounded wait for the others. Incomplete is reported only after every application is terminal and is never turned into Complete."
 ],
